<title>USA: Continental Health FY96 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Continental Health FY96 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CLIFFS, N.J. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>June 30 end</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.09     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		   856     loss	   958</p>
<p> Revs			69,880		   56,044</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,418		    7,825</p>
<p>(All data above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE - Fiscal year 1996 figures include a gain of $0.08 per share related to selling the operating assets of a long-term health care facility while retaining the property.  </p>
<p>Full company name is Continental Health Affiliates Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
